{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-9006-1",
  "summary": "perl vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Pod::Text in Perl did not properly handle POD\ndocuments with deeply nested =over directives. If a user or automated\nsystem were tricked into processing a specially crafted file, an\nattacker could possibly use this issue to cause CPU and memory\nexhaustion, resulting in a denial of service.",
